{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6719690144","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1241#issuecomment-6719690144","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1241","id":6719690144,"node_id":"IC_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABkIZVoA","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?u=4a54630ef210e4f76a452eea65cda1b56370734c&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-11-08T09:14:30Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T09:14:30Z","author_association":"MEMBER","body":"Additional exact targets of `W02-F-TYPE` / `W01-W02-PREP-TYPE-001`, verified against published W02 `f0d2be8b220d9e0c6ae415704d291ed40d3c292e`. These are seven further nutrient basal preparations, distinct from the sodium-resazurin correction already recorded in comment6719443273.\n\nThe current `filed-followups-v1/HANDOFF.json` selects `filed-followups-v1/selected-v3`. All seven payload paths and hashes below remain selected and match both disk and the published Git blobs. Native `SolutionTypeEnum.MINERAL_STOCK` means “Concentrated mineral stock solution”; `OTHER` means “Other type of pre-mixed solution.” These sources establish separately prepared nutrient basal materials, so the supported bounded correction is `solution_type: OTHER` for each.\n\n| Exact selected proposal | Primary source and preparation boundary | Current payload SHA256 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `a2-proposal-jcm480-preaddition-basal-preparation` | [JCM480 / TOGO M481](https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=480): Yeast extract0.5g, Casitone0.5g, trace vitamins and salts in900mL added water; basal autoclaved before separate phosphate/carbon/bicarbonate/reductant additions. | `35db9be9de92588c8c6b5686bc0dda6638a06213e404195d5cbfc4001d36fa4d` |\n| `a2-proposal-jcm438-preaddition-basal-preparation` | [JCM438 / TOGO M438](https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=438): Yeast extract0.5g and CAPSO11.86g plus salts in900mL added water; basal prepared before separate lactate/dithionite additions. | `420eef750813f96bc3d60cb0ca48a6d64621cf9cbff80ce244f24412e75ad3cc` |\n| `a2-proposal-togo-m491-preaddition-basal-preparation` | [TOGO M491](https://togomedium.org/sparqlist/api/gmdb_medium_by_gmid?gm_id=M491): Successful provider Sol.1 table: yeast extract0.5g, Casitone0.5g, vitamins, phosphate/mineral salts and900mL added water; provider-specific basal scope retained. | `19dbafdbb482d84410c7f468b40a072c1fd4d4cc796b7d23e78b88ec9babe457` |\n| `a2-proposal-jcm537-preaddition-basal-preparation` | [JCM537 / TOGO M539](https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=537): Yeast extract4g, casein peptone2g and salts in1L added water; basal dispensed/autoclaved before stock injections. | `e6f95a0685f2edad28fea77b6f902415e6dfec547f39519c81e564d1fc70c147` |\n| `a2-proposal-jcm573-preaddition-basal-preparation` | [JCM573 / TOGO M577](https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=573): Yeast extract2g and salts in900mL added water; basal dispensed/autoclaved before magnesium/bicarbonate/sulfide stocks. | `c645fba326d23f43a5621f29b6562726595044960a9a210e29ed0fe2777ae97b` |\n| `a2-proposal-jcm706-preaddition-basal-preparation` | [JCM706 / TOGO M728](https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=706): Yeast extract2g, Trypticase2g, glucose3.6g and salts in940mL added water; basal prepared before later stocks. | `628b95a7b06eb597817c02bad1f94b9c666ddec00219692be27ae092215da3b3` |\n| `a2-proposal-jcm525-mineral-yeast-basal-preparation` | [JCM525 / TOGO M526](https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=525): Dissolved medium constituents, including yeast extract0.1g, in500mL added water, adjusted to pH0.8 and autoclaved separately from chalcopyrite suspension. | `58d80ce8654f651428175d8eb5526187ab74e5d8945dc5696c866be9d9829d1a` |\n\nAll seven originate in case58, `CM_NAME:5d56ea306928dff3c50ac9c4131052b3c20acd05e613f9ada5e372418cc549d0` (“Sol. 1”), but each has its own exact recipe occurrence. The full case retains24 occurrences; this correction concerns seven of them, not seven copies of the whole case. The hash ledger preserves each original occurrence ID, raw component/quantity, full frozen recipe, source-body hash and retrieval metadata. Do not reinterpret literal added-water quantities as measured final stock volumes or change the preparation partition.\n\nPrepare an immutable guarded successor changing only these seven `solution_type` values and appending truthful LLM-assisted curation history. Preserve all prior history, identities, mappings, aliases, components, component assertions, source text, quantities, processing descriptions and existing holds. Rebind dependent proposal/case/evidence selectors to the exact new bytes, retain every source-case/outcome, run focused preservation/schema checks, and obtain independent exact-byte re-review. No new schema, type, threshold, role or owner decision is needed. Existing enum validation passes both the current and proposed category; this is a source-semantic defect, not a structural validation failure.\n\nBoundary: do not add DSMZ40 mixed C/D/E as an eighth confirmed target. DSMZ40 inherits DSMZ29; C is bicarbonate buffer, D contains resazurin/water, and E contains mineral salts plus ammonium acetate, sodium pyruvate and dextrose. Those preparations are mixed and dosed into A. That mixed concentrate boundary differs from the seven explicitly prepared nutrient basal media. `OTHER` may be clearer, but no automatic reclassification follows from one organic ingredient or an amount threshold. Preserve its already-corrected section-volume/added-water qualifications.\n\nNo source disagreement changes the seven-target category conclusion. TOGO M491 remains explicitly provider-defined: its original JCM490 capture returned Nothing found, its phosphate grouping differs from JCM480, and the source comments distinguish a glucose substitution from the predecessor mannitol preparation. None is silently reconciled, and a failed direct-page retrieval is not affirmative evidence against the successful provider recipe. No component identity or complete formulation is newly approved here.\n\nEvidence: the three immutable W01 findings `finding-W01-W02-PREP-TYPE-001-{v1,scope-addendum-v1,seventh-target-addendum-v1}.json`, independently rebound in coordinator packet `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/w02-seven-preparation-triage-v1`. `hash-ledger.json` contains exact selected proposal/source/occurrence/history bindings; `narrow-schema-checks.json` contains seven current and seven in-memory OTHER-only schema passes. No candidate, maintained record, GitHub state or worker artifact was changed by this triage. It does not re-review the untouched110 selected proposals or grant owner, component, role, mapping-release or export approval.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6719690144/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"pin":null}